    "font" : "SFRM1095",
    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Proof. We begin by verifying Assumption (A). Recall that Dom(LC0) is a core of L by Theorem 7. For all f ∈ Dom(LC0) we have Lˆv(f ◦ π) = 0 hence Lˆtr is a lift of L by Remark 8. Furthermore, for f ∈ Dom(LC0) one has"
  }, {
