    "id" : 30,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 89.291, 308.799, 429.992, 346.352 ],
    "font" : "SFRM1095",
    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Lˆ∗tr(f ◦ π)(x,v) = −v1{0<x<L}f′(x) = −Lˆtr(f ◦ π)(x,v). A straightforward computation yields"
  }, {
